Call, email, or send us a note below and we&#x27;ll get back to you.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="tel:+16618596040" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-none border-2 px-8 py-3.5 font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] transition-[background-color,color,border-color,transform,box-shadow] duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background active:translate-y-px border-primary bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-transparent hover:text-primary hover:shadow-[0_0_0_3px_oklch(0.79_0.13_84/0.18)] active:bg-primary/80 active:text-primary-foreground active:shadow-none">Call <!-- -->(661) 859 6040</a><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=5880+District+Blvd+Ste+18+Bakersfield+CA+93313" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-none border-2 px-8 py-3.5 font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] transition-[background-color,color,border-color,transform,box-shadow] duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background active:translate-y-px border-primary/50 text-primary hover:border-primary hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground active:bg-primary/80 active:text-primary-foreground">Get Directions</a></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-28 "><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-12"><div class=""><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr]"><div class="space-y-10"><div><h2 class="eyebrow">Find us</h2><address class="mt-3 space-y-1 text-lg not-italic text-muted-foreground"><div>5880 District Blvd, Ste 18</div><div>Bakersfield<!-- -->, <!-- -->CA<!-- --> <!-- -->93313</div></address></div><div><h2 class="eyebrow">Call us</h2><a href="tel:+16618596040" class="mt-3 block font-display text-2xl text-primary">(661) 859 6040</a></div><div><h2 class="eyebrow">Email us</h2><a href="mailto:info@crusaderbrewing.com" class="mt-3 block break-all font-display text-xl text-primary">info@crusaderbrewing.com</a><p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Taproom questions, private events, the stage, and food truck bookings all go here.</p></div><div><h2 class="eyebrow">Hours</h2><ul class="mt-3 divide-y divide-border"><li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground"><span>Sunday to Monday</span><span class="text-foreground">Closed for family and brewing</span></li><li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground"><span>Tuesday to Friday</span><span class="text-foreground">3 pm to 9 pm</span></li><li class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-2 text-muted-foreground"><span>Saturday</span><span class="text-foreground">12 pm to 9 pm</span></li></ul></div></div><div class="rounded-sm border border-border bg-card/40 p-8 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold uppercase">Send us a message</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Tell us what you need and we&#x27;ll reply within a day or two. For anything urgent, like tonight&#x27;s event or a table for a big group, please call the taproom instead.</p><form class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><input required="" placeholder="First name" aria-label="First name" class="w-full rounded-sm border border-input bg-background px-5 py-3.5 text-sm outline-none transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30" name="first"/><input required="" placeholder="Last name" aria-label="Last name" class="w-full rounded-sm border border-input bg-background px-5 py-3.5 text-sm outline-none transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30" name="last"/><input required="" type="email" placeholder="Email" aria-label="Email" class="w-full rounded-sm border border-input bg-background px-5 py-3.5 text-sm outline-none transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30" name="email"/><input type="tel" placeholder="Phone" aria-label="Phone" class="w-full rounded-sm border border-input bg-background px-5 py-3.5 text-sm outline-none transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30" name="phone"/><select name="topic" aria-label="What is this about?" class="w-full rounded-sm border border-input bg-background px-5 py-3.5 text-sm outline-none transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30 sm:col-span-2"><option value="" disabled="" selected="">What is this about?</option><option>General question</option><option>Private event or venue rental</option><option>Food truck booking</option><option>Mug Club</option><option>Live music or booking the stage</option><option>Something else</option></select><textarea required="" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Message" aria-label="Message" class="w-full rounded-sm border border-input bg-background px-5 py-3.5 text-sm outline-none transition-colors hover:border-primary/60 focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/30 sm:col-span-2"></textarea><button type="submit" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-none border-2 px-8 py-3.5 font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] transition-[background-color,color,border-color,transform,box-shadow] duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background active:translate-y-px border-primary bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-transparent hover:text-primary hover:shadow-[0_0_0_3px_oklch(0.79_0.13_84/0.18)] active:bg-primary/80 active:text-primary-foreground active:shadow-none sm:col-span-2 disabled:opacity-60">Send Message</button></form></div></div></div></div></section><script>(function(a,f){let l;try{l=JSON.pa